        "@value": "H2O [lysosomal lumen] + PSAP(195-273):Gal2Cer:PE [lysosomal lumen] => GalCer [lysosomal lumen] + PE 30,32,34 [lysosomal lumen] + PSAP(195-273) dimer [lysosomal lumen] + Gal [lysosomal lumen]"
