        "@value": "NADP+ [cytosol] + 4a-carboxy-5a-cholest-8-en-3b-ol [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] => NADPH [cytosol] + 5a-cholest-8-en-3-one [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + CO2 [cytosol]"
