        "@value": "H+ [cytosol] + NADPH [cytosol] + 4a-me-5a-cholest-8-en-3-one [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] => 4a-me-5a-cholest-8-en-3b-ol [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + NADP+ [cytosol]"
